me":0.8,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"426d439b-aca9-5749-aa9d-8301973ab810","time":0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0.0,"y":45.0,"z":0.0}],"uuid":"52f7d6cc-7836-59ca-abc6-26bfc5f9feb3","time":0.8,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]}}}],"description":"# spell_warding\n\nSupport-mage warding: a dome of faint green runes about 6 m across (radius 107 u) that settles over nearby allies; enemy spell hits are softened inside.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -108..108, y 0..141, z -108..108 units (6.08 x 3.95 x 6.08 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 143.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 216 x 141 x 216 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rise` | 1.0 | once | the dome rises out of the ground ring and settles (slight overshoot) |\n| `loop` | 8.0 | loop | runes turn slowly round the dome |\n| `fade` | 0.8 | once | the dome lifts and turns away as it fades (alpha is the game's) |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_base0, glow_base1, glow_base10, glow_base11, glow_base12, glow_base13, glow_base14, glow_base15, glow_base16, glow_base17, glow_base18, glow_base19 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"}